    "@en": "快 describes the speed when running."
   }
  },
  "说 一 说": {
   "es": "hablar un poco; comentar brevemente",
   "en": "talk a little; comment briefly",
   "pron": "SHUŌ YÌ SHUŌ",
   "consejo": {
    "@es": "La repetición suaviza o acorta la acción.",
    "@en": "The repetition softens or shortens the action."
   }
  },
  "听 一 听": {
